OL,3,GNEWSAInternet access suspended at
OL,4,Adozens of schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FA potential security incident has
OL,7,Fcaused a major city-wide internet
OL,8,Foutage in about 80 council-run primary,
OL,9,Fsecondary and special educational needs
OL,10,Fand disabilities (SEND) schools.
OL,12,FBristol City Council said it had
OL,13,Fsuspended access to its Trading with
OL,14,FSchools internet network earlier as a
OL,15,Fprecautionary measure while the problem
OL,16,Fwas investigated. All affected schools
OL,17,Fhad been contacted by the council, a
OL,18,Fspokesperson for the authority said.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
