OL,3,GNEWSAInternet access suspended at
OL,4,Adozens of schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the schools affected, St Mary
OL,7,FRedcliffe, said it remained open and
OL,8,Fsafe for students and staff but could
OL,9,Fbe without its phone lines and usual
OL,10,Fsystems for some time.
OL,12,FThe council advised that the disruption
OL,13,Fcould potentially continue into early
OL,14,Fnext week.
